From 5cb8e9c682ac3534ff68a3186349f063dafa657d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:04:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] AB monitor 1.6.4: Prometheus exporter 0.2.0, Grafana
 dashboard, Python 3.7 on RHEL 9

- exporter 0.2.0: continuous (pull and/or push, --count, --no-http) or single
  run (--once to a Pushgateway, exit codes 0/1/2); --print-json dict per poll;
  library API poll_once/iter_updates/run(on_update)/snapshot; writes no files
- ab_grafana_dashboard.py 0.0.1: overview + one row per meter, one panel per
  unit (all parameters of a unit as traces), unitless table; per-ip or repeat
  layout; JSON, provisioning or HTTP API upload (token from environment)
- monitoring/: Prometheus config, Grafana provisioning + dashboard, systemd
  single-run timer, Prometheus and Pushgateway units, Windows scripts, guide
- monitor 1.6.4: kVAh unit
- install.sh 1.2.0: RHEL 9 + Python 3.7 (env in prefix, pip 24.0, wheels only,
  SELinux bin_t, firewalld, --once-timer); services: start limits in [Unit]
- requirements-py37 / environment-py37: verified on 3.7.12 with pip 24.0
- tests: exporter 0.0.3 (dict, push, single run, no files), dashboard 0.0.1,
  runner 0.0.2 (nine suites); docs and PDFs regenerated

Verified with Prometheus 3.5.0, Pushgateway 1.11.1, Grafana 12.2.0.
Local commit only; not pushed (owner's instruction).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
